  "reference": "Balamuji 1",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baisilaeli kongeja kūdima sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho waacha ū Yoshwa, a Baisilaeli būmūūja ū SEEBA gīkī, “Nani atonge ū kūjiilwisha būlūgū nabo a Bakanaani, kūlwa kūtūlwīīlīla?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūhaya, “Yuda h'ūyo akūtonga, nguno ī sī yenīyo naang'winhile wei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bagosha ba mu lūganda lwa Yuda būbawīla a badūgū babo a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Simioni gīkī, “Nzūgi tūje tūkilwishe nabo būlūgū a Bakanaani abo balī ū mu sī yise; hanuma ya henaho na a bise tūkūja hamò ning'we tūkalwe nabo abo balī ū mu sī ying'we.” Na ng'hana a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Simioni būja hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda būlinha bajile, būūkalwa nabo būlūgū ipandī lya Bezeki; ū SEEBA ūbatūūla mu makono gabo a banishi babo a Bakanaani, na a Bapelizi; būbabūlaga banhū shihūmbī ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A h'ipandī lyenīlo h'aho bakansangīla nū Adoni-bezeki, būūlwa nang'hwe; būbapyena kībi kībi a Bakanaani na a Bapelizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Adoni-bezeki ūpeela, alīyo būnkūūbīja ūko akajiibisa būkandima; būntīna a makuulume ga kū makono na a ga kū mhambala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Adoni-bezeki ūhaya gīkī, “Ū nene ng'wenekīlī naabīta kūtīna makuulume ga makono na ga magūlū, ga batemi makūmi mpungatī, hūna būyūūlya shilīwa sha kūsoleleja hasī ng'wikūlū lyane. Ī haha ū Mulungu wanilīpa nane kūlwa yenīyo īyo naayīīta.” Būnsola būja nang'hwe Yelusalemu, ūūkachīla kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda bakalwa būlūgū na a banhū ba Yelusalemu, būgūdima ū nzengo gwenūyo. Būūbabūlaga wa lūshū pye a biikaji ba ng'wene, hūna ū nzengo būgūpemba moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho, a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda būja kūlwa būlūgū na Bakanaani abo bikalaga kū sī ja magūlya, na ba Negevu, na a babo bikalaga kū sī ja ntubīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūbasanga na Bakanaani biikalaga Holebu (ī kale gwitanagwa Kiliati-alaba), nabo būbapyena, hamò na mizengo ya Sheshai, Ahimani, na Talimai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīnga a henaho būūkabadumīla na banhū ba Debili (ī kale yitanagwa Kiliati-shefeli). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Kelebu ūhaya gīkī, “Ūyo alagūdumīle ū nzengo gwa Kiliati-shefeli agūdiime, nakūng'winha ū nshīke wane ū Akisa abize nke wakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osnieli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Kenazi ūyo walī ng'wana wa ng'wawe na Kelebu ūgūdima ū nzengo gwenūyo; na lūūlū ū Kelebu ūnfūnya u nshīke wakwe ū Akisa atoolwe nū Osinieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wiza ho bandya kwikala hamò, lūshikū lūmò ūnkomiga akanombe ilaale ū ise. Aho wika a ha nzobe yakwe, ū Kelebu ūmūūja, “Ūlītogwa nakwītīle mhayo kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nshīke ūhaya, “Baba nigunanhage; waninhile ilaale mu Negevu, ninhage na malambo ga minzī.” Ū Kelebu ūng'winha malambo abīlī, līmò kū ngūlya, līngī kū ntulumenho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha būkwiye o ng'wa Musa, a Bakeni, bīnga ū mu nzengo gwa Mitende,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nzengo gwa mitende:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hu nzengo gwa Yeliko.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " hamò na banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda; būja kwitogolo lya Negevu būūkikala kwenūko, na banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda, bbihī na Aladi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda būja hangī hamò na a baana ba ng'wabo a ba lūganda lwa Simioni, būūkabadumīla Bakanaani ba Zefati. Būūbapyena na kūgūkenaagūla gete ū nzengo gwabo; kwandīja henaho ū nzengo gwenūyo gwitanwa Holima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Holima:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "A makūlū ga Holima gali, kukenaagula nūūlū bukenaaguji.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda bīdima na mizengo ya Gaza, Ashikeloni, na Ekuloni; būlī nzengo na magūngūli gaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA walī hamò nabo a banhū ba lūganda lwa Yuda; bīdima nī sī ya magūlya, gwike būlemeelwa ū kūbapeeja a banhū ba mu sī ja mbūga, nguno a bene baalī na magogoteni ga chūūma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Hebuloni yene winhwa Kelebu gīt'ūmo Musa walī wabalagīīlīla; ū Kelebu ūgapeeja mahanga adatū ga Baanaki kūfuma ū ng'wipandī lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini būlemeelwa ū kūbapeeja a Bayebusi abo biikalaga ū mu nzengo gwa Yelusalemu; na lūūlū kūshisha lelo yenīy'a Bayebusi balīmo ū mu Yelusalemu, bakwikalaga hamò nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sī ījo shiigelile jiding'we wangū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba numba ya n'gwa Yosefu nabo būgūdumīla nzengo gwa Beeseli; na a bene ū SEEBA walī hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Yosefu benabo bakatūma badati, kūjūgūdata ū nzengo gwa Beeseli (ī kwandya gwitanagwa Luzu). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A badati benabo būmona mhunhū alīfuma ū mu nzengo gwenūyo, būng'wīla gīkī, “Bebe alitoolekejage ī nzīla ya kwingīlīla ū mu nzengo; tūkūkūbeegeja yawiza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūboolekeja ng'hana, bingīla mo būūkabamala kūbabūlaga a banhū baamo, būnekeela dūhū ū munhū ng'wenūyo nī kaya yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo akīīta ūsaama mo, ūja kū sī ya Bahītī ūūkazenga nzengo ūgwitana Luzu, nī lelo gūtaalī gūkwitanagwa ī lina lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase batabapeegije a bajiga jiga ba mu Beti-shani nūūlū ī Taanaki, pye na a ba Dooli, nī Ibelamu nūūlū ī Megido na a magūngūli ayo gaalī gīpīndije; nguno a Bakanaani benabo baaalī baalemela ū mu sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a Baisilaeli aho baabiza na nguzu, būbatūūla a Bakanaani mu milīmo ya būsese wa hadī; gwike ū gwa kūbapeeja bīnge mo gete batagwītile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu batabapeegije a Bakanaani abo bikalaga mu Geza, alīyo a Bakanaani ba mu Geza benabo bakabiza bikaji ba ng'wenūmo hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Zabuloni batabapeegije a Bakanaani abo bikalga Kitiloni, na a ba Nahaloli abo baalī baasaagīīla mo, alīyo bakabatūūla mu milīmo ya būsese wa hadī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Asheli batabapeegije a Bakanaani abo biikalalaga Ako, nūūlū ī Sidoni, nī Ahilabu; nūūlū ī Akizibu, nī Heliba, na ba Afeki, nūūlū a ba Lehobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū kūlwa yenīyo, a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Asheli būbiza ba kwikala hamò na a Bakanaani abo baalī ū mu sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Nafutali batabapeegije abo biikalaga Beti-shemeshi, nī Beti-anati; alīyo nabo a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Nafutali bakikala dūhū na a Bakanaani abo baalī bajiga jiga ba mu sī yenīyo; gwike dūhū abo bikalaga Beti-shemeshi nī Beti-anati, būbatūūla mu milīmo ya būsese wa hadī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baamooli bakabahangīgīja kū sī ja maalūgūlū ga banhū ba lūgandalwa ng'wa Dani, būbalemeja gete ū kwika ū kū sī ī ja mbūga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baamooli benabo baalī na ng'hūmbū ja kūdima na sī jingī ja kū ngūlū, gītī Helesi, Aijaloni, na Shalibimu, alīyo a banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Yosefu būbaheeba ī nguzu; būbatūūla mu milīmo ya būsese wa hadī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūbīmbī lwa sī ya Baamooli lwalī kūfuma kū nzīla ya ng'homi kūja Seela, na kūja kū būtongi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
